  "description": "The Flightline 24 Plus DS can hang with the best of them. Fully off-road ready, the FL 24 Plus DS is built on a solid platform that includes a rust and worry free 6000 alloy low-profile frame matched, for 2019, to a new light and rigid alloy fork. It features Plus size 2.6\" MTB tires mounted to wider 32mm alloy double walled rims making Trail bumps so small you might not even know they were there. A Shimano 8-speed Rapidfire shifter and Altus rear derailleur offer easy and smooth shifting with a simple and intuitive 1X drive-train, while its all-weather Tektro Hydraulic disc brakes with Junior-size levers will do the job when it is time to stop.\nHaro FL 24\" Plus 6000 Series alloy frame w/ IS disc mount\n1-1/8\" internal Threadless headset\nNew Full 6000 Series alloy 1-1/8\" rigid fork\nShimano Altus 8-speed rear derailleur\nShimano Altus RapidFire, 8-spd shifter\nShimano HG-200 8-spd 12-32t cassette\nNew Tektro HD-M276 brakeset w/ 160mm rotors\n32mm alloy DW Disc rims\nAlloy cassette 32h hubs\nH-5183 24\"x2.60\" tires",
